note bottom of JurorRecordController
  PATCH /api/v1/moj/juror-record/mark-summoned/{juror_number}
  HTTP 200 OK with an empty body.
end note

note bottom of JurorRecordServiceImpl
  @Transactional
  Requires current status UNDELIVERABLE.
  Sets status to SUMMONED, nextDate to pool return date,
  and userEdtq to the active login; records history.
end note

note bottom of JurorPoolUtils
  Bureau: select latest active association by return date.
  Court: select an active association matching the owner.
  getActiveJurorPoolRecords is called on the court path.
end note

